          "**2. The Decoding Phase (Autoregressive Generation):**",
          "Once the KV Cache is computed and the first token is born, the model switches to sequential autoregression. Generating subsequent tokens is memory-bandwidth bound rather than compute bound. This phase is measured by **Throughput / Output Speed (Tokens Per Second - TPS)**."
