          "Now swap that model for an ultra-low latency architecture like **Gemini 4 Hydrogen** or a provider with an optimized **150ms TTFT**: 15 steps × 0.15s = **2.25 seconds total wait time**. The exact same logic finishes nearly 35 seconds faster simply because the initialization penalty was erased."
        ]
